{
 "WorldMemBench: Does a Video World Model Remember? · REAL Lab Blog": "WorldMemBench: Does a Video World Model Remember? · REAL Lab 博客",
 "WorldMemBench tests whether video world models remember what they showed: 260 cases of controlled camera departures and repeated returns, scoring static content against a fixed reference and off-screen events with checklists. Nine models evaluated.": "WorldMemBench 用于检验视频世界模型能否记住已生成的内容：共 260 个样例，相机按受控路径离开并多次返回；静态内容与固定参考比对，画面外事件按检查清单评分。共评测 9 个模型。",
 "Turn the camera away and come back: does the world a video model generated still look the same, and did what was happening keep happening?": "镜头移开再返回后，视频模型生成的世界是否保持一致，此前正在发生的事件是否继续发展。",
