 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 22, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>World models · Benchmark</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>12 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 22 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>世界模型 · 评测基准</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 12 分钟</span>",
 "Video world models can now generate half a minute of explorable world. But turn the camera away and come back: is it still the same world, and did what was happening keep happening? WorldMemBench measures exactly that.": "当前的视频世界模型已能生成半分钟、可自由探索的场景。镜头移开再返回后，场景是否保持不变，此前正在发生的事件是否继续发展，正是 WorldMemBench 测量的内容。",
