 "<a href=\"#cite\">Citation</a>": "<a href=\"#cite\">引用</a>",
 "TL;DR": "要点",
 "A video world model generates a world you can move through. Moving means things leave the frame and come back into it. A model that only produces good frames can still forget a person’s face, swap an object, rearrange a room, or freeze an event that should have kept going while the camera looked away.": "视频世界模型生成的是可在其中移动的世界。移动意味着内容会移出画面，随后又重新进入。仅能生成高质量单帧的模型，仍可能记错人物面貌、替换物体、改变房间布局，或在镜头移开期间使本应持续的事件停滞。",
 "WorldMemBench tests this directly. In 260 cases across 23 categories, the camera follows a controlled path away from something it has seen and back, once or several times. <strong>Static content</strong>, people, objects and scenes, is compared at every return against the same reference from the start. <strong>Dynamic events</strong>, such as pages being turned or ice melting, are checked with case-specific questions about whether they progressed while out of view. Video quality and camera-following accuracy are reported alongside, so that memory scores can be read in context.": "WorldMemBench 直接检验这一能力。基准包含 23 个类别共 260 个样例，相机沿受控路径离开已观察的内容并返回，一次或多次。<strong>静态内容</strong>包括人物、物体和场景，每次返回均与起始时的同一参考比对。<strong>动态事件</strong>如翻书、冰块融化，按样例设置专门问题，检查事件在视野之外是否继续推进。视频质量与相机跟随精度同时报告，作为解读记忆分数的参照。",
 "<strong>Across nine recent world models, the one that remembers static content best, HY-WorldPlay, starts only 31.7% of the events it is asked to show; and every model forgets more with each return.</strong> No model leads on all four dimensions.": "<strong>在九个近期世界模型中，静态记忆最好的 HY-WorldPlay 仅使 31.7% 的指定事件真正开始；所有模型的记忆均随返回次数增加而衰减。</strong>没有模型在四个维度上全面领先。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">Static memory vs dynamic memory</p><p class=\"card-t\">Remembering is not evolving</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">Nine-model average, first to third return</p><p class=\"card-t\">Every return forgets a bit more</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2, static memory (mean of seven metrics)</p><p class=\"card-t\">Choosing what to remember helps</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">Agreement with blinded human judgments</p><p class=\"card-t\">The metrics match people</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#results\"><p class=\"card-k\">静态记忆 vs 动态记忆</p><p class=\"card-t\">记住不等于持续演化</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#revisits\"><p class=\"card-k\">九个模型均值，第一次至第三次返回</p><p class=\"card-t\">记忆随返回次数衰减</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#context\"><p class=\"card-k\">LingBot World v2 的静态记忆（七项指标均值）</p><p class=\"card-t\">选择性保留历史帧可提升记忆</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#trust\"><p class=\"card-k\">与人工盲评的一致率</p><p class=\"card-t\">自动指标与人工判断一致</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>What world memory is": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>什么是世界记忆",
 "Autoregressive video generation has become long and stable enough, and camera and action control precise enough, that “video world models” now let you explore a generated place for tens of seconds. Exploration constantly moves content in and out of view. We call <strong>world memory</strong> the ability to keep what has been established, and to keep it evolving coherently, across those interruptions.": "自回归视频生成的时长与稳定性不断提高，相机与动作控制也日益精确，“视频世界模型”已可支持在生成场景中探索数十秒。探索过程中，画面内容不断移出和移入视野。本文将在这些中断下保持已确立内容、并使其连贯演化的能力称为<strong>世界记忆</strong>。",
 "It has two halves. <strong>Static memory</strong>: a person’s identity and clothes, an object’s look and shape, a room’s layout and depth should all be the same when you look again. <strong>Dynamic memory</strong>: something that was happening should have continued while you looked away, and its consequences should be visible when you return. Frame-level quality and local smoothness say nothing about either.": "世界记忆包括两部分。<strong>静态记忆</strong>：人物的身份与衣着、物体的外观与形状、房间的布局与深度，再次观察时均应保持不变。<strong>动态记忆</strong>：视线移开期间，正在发生的事件应持续发生，视线返回时应能看到其结果。帧级画质与局部平滑度均无法反映这两方面。",
 "Earlier benchmarks examine pieces of this, such as revisit consistency, or state evolution while unobserved, and one recent benchmark tests recall across repeated loops. WorldMemBench puts them together: long revisits, repeated revisits, state evolution and physical consistency, with camera control and video quality measured in the same rollouts.": "已有评测基准分别考察过其中部分方面，如回访一致性、无人观察时的状态演化，近期也有基准测试多轮循环后的回忆能力。WorldMemBench 将这些方面整合在一起，覆盖长间隔回访、多次回访、状态演化与物理一致性，并在同一批 rollout 上同时测量相机控制和视频质量。",
 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>Leave, and come back": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>离开与回访",
 "Every case starts from a conditioning frame, the initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>. The camera then follows a prescribed path that takes it away and brings it back: a departure <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> followed by a revisit <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>. Rotations keep the camera in place and turn it left and right (yaw) or up and down (pitch); translations keep its heading and walk a square. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> plays real rollouts from the benchmark, all generated by LingBot World v2.": "每个样例以一帧条件帧为起点，即初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span>。随后相机按预设路径离开并返回，分别记为离开 <span class=\"mi\">D<sub>i</sub></span> 和回访 <span class=\"mi\">R<sub>i</sub></span>。旋转类轨迹中，相机位置固定，左右转动（yaw）或上下转动（pitch）；平移类轨迹中，相机朝向不变，沿正方形移动一周。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 播放基准中的真实 rollout，均由 LingBot World v2 生成。",
 "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>Pause</span>": "<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewbox=\"0 0 12 12\"><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"2\" y=\"1.5\"></rect><rect fill=\"currentColor\" height=\"9\" rx=\".6\" width=\"2.6\" x=\"7.4\" y=\"1.5\"></rect></svg><span>暂停</span>",
 "Loading the rollout…": "rollout 加载中…",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> The departure-and-revisit protocol on one street scene (environment case 010, generated by LingBot World v2). <b>LRLRLR</b>: the camera stays in place and turns 80° left and back three times (1° per frame, 80 frames per turn), returning at frames 160, 320 and 480. <b>LRLR</b>: two 90° turns (0.75° per frame, 120 frames per turn). <b>LRUD</b>: a 90° left–right cycle, then a 90° up–down cycle, so the second return comes along a new axis. <b>Translation</b> (a different case): the camera keeps its heading and walks forward, right, back and left around a square; the dot’s position is approximate. Each return is scored against the same initial view <span class=\"mi\">V</span>; the thumbnails fill in as the video reaches each return.": "<b>图 1：</b>离开与回访协议示例，样例为环境类第 010 号街景，由 LingBot World v2 生成。<b>LRLRLR</b>：相机原地向左转 80° 再转回，重复三次，每帧转动 1°，每次转动 80 帧，分别在第 160、320、480 帧回到原位。<b>LRLR</b>：两次 90° 往返，每帧转动 0.75°，每次转动 120 帧。<b>LRUD</b>：先完成一次 90° 左右往返，再完成一次 90° 上下往返，第二次返回改沿另一轴完成。<b>平移</b>：取自另一样例，相机朝向不变，依次向前、向右、向后、向左绕正方形移动一周，圆点位置为近似值。每次返回均与同一初始视图 <span class=\"mi\">V</span> 比对；视频播放到某次返回时，对应缩略图随之显示。",
 "260 cases, 23 categories": "260 个样例，分属 23 个类别",
 "The benchmark has 60 Human, 70 Object and 70 Environment cases, which form the 200-case static-memory set, and 60 Dynamic cases covering seven kinds of state change: motion, assembly, removal, deformation, transfer, reaction and thermal change. Video quality is measured on all 200 static rollouts, and camera following on 85 of them whose trajectories suit pose estimation.": "静态记忆集共 200 个样例，其中人物 60 个、物体 70 个、环境 70 个；动态部分另有 60 个样例，涵盖运动、组装、移除、形变、转移、反应和热变化七类状态变化。视频质量在全部 200 段静态 rollout 上评测，相机跟随在其中轨迹适合位姿估计的 85 段上评测。",
 "Composition": "样例构成",
 "Four families, 23 categories": "四大类，23 个类别",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> Case families and their categories (paper Figure 2). Hover a block for its family.": "<b>图 2：</b>样例的四个大类及其下属类别，对应论文图 2。鼠标悬停于色块可查看所属大类。",
 "Scoring what stays": "静态记忆的评分",
 "For static content, each revisit is compared with a <strong>fixed reference</strong> from the initial view, never with the previous return, so that errors cannot hide by drifting slowly. Scores are averaged over revisits and then over targets, and a prescribed revisit with no valid observation counts as zero.": "静态内容的每次回访均与初始视图中的<strong>固定参考</strong>比较，而非与上一次返回比较，以免误差借缓慢漂移逃过检测。分数先在各次回访上平均，再在各目标上平均；按计划应有但缺少有效观测的回访记为 0 分。",
 "<strong>People</strong>: identity from ArcFace face embeddings, and appearance from DINOv2 features inside the person’s mask.": "<strong>人物</strong>：身份采用 ArcFace 人脸嵌入衡量，外观采用人物掩码区域内的 DINOv2 特征衡量。",
 "<strong>Objects</strong>: the target is found again at each return by detection and video segmentation; appearance from DINOv2 features in the mask, and geometry as the IoU of the silhouettes after normalizing position and scale.": "<strong>物体</strong>：每次返回时通过检测与视频分割重新定位目标；外观采用掩码内的 DINOv2 特征衡量，几何则在归一化位置与尺度后计算轮廓的 IoU。",
 "<strong>Environments</strong>: visible content from global DINOv2 features at the return frame whose camera orientation is closest to the start; relative depth order as the Spearman correlation of depth maps; and 3D structure by projecting both depth maps onto a shared spherical grid and comparing the reconstructed surfaces.": "<strong>环境</strong>：选取相机朝向最接近起始朝向的返回帧，可见内容采用全局 DINOv2 特征衡量；相对深度顺序采用两张深度图的 Spearman 相关系数衡量；3D 结构则将两张深度图投影到同一球面网格上，比较重建表面。",
 "Scoring what changes": "动态记忆的评分",
 "A dynamic event cannot be scored by similarity to the first frame, because the right answer is a different frame. Each dynamic case instead specifies an initial state, an action and the expected next state. A vision-language model (Qwen3.8-27B) first decides whether the event visibly starts at all; if it does not, the case scores zero. Otherwise it answers eight yes/no questions with fixed reference answers, two each on return progress, persistence, final state and causal or physical consistency. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">Figure 3</a> shows a real case.": "动态事件无法按与首帧的相似度评分，因为正确的画面本应与首帧不同。因此，每个动态样例均规定初始状态、动作和预期的下一状态。评分时，视觉语言模型 Qwen3.8-27B 首先判断事件是否在画面中明显开始；若未开始，该样例记 0 分。若已开始，再回答八道带固定参考答案的是非题，返回进展、状态保持、最终状态以及因果或物理一致性各两题。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-3\">图 3</a> 展示一个真实样例。",
 "hold": "静止",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> A dynamic case (case 023, generated by LingBot World v2): a hand turns the pages of a book. The camera holds, turns 60° away, holds while the pages should keep turning off-screen, turns back, and holds on the result. The eight checklist questions and their reference answers are the case’s released checklist; each lights up when the part of the video it is judged on is playing.": "<b>图 3：</b>第 023 号动态样例，由 LingBot World v2 生成：一只手翻动书页。相机先静止，随后转开 60° 并保持，此时书页应在画面外继续翻动；之后转回并停留在结果画面上。八个检查问题及参考答案取自该样例公开的检查清单，视频播放到某一问题所依据的片段时，该问题随之高亮。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>Nine models, four dimensions": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>九个模型，四个维度",
 "We evaluate HY-WorldPlay, Matrix-Game 3 and 3.5, SANA-WM, YUME, LingBot World and LingBot World v2, Evoke and DreamX World, each with the defaults of its official release and fixed seeds, converting the benchmark trajectories into each model’s own control format.": "参评模型共九个：HY-WorldPlay、Matrix-Game 3 和 3.5、SANA-WM、YUME、LingBot World 和 LingBot World v2、Evoke、DreamX World。各模型均采用官方发布版本的默认设置并固定随机种子，基准中的相机轨迹转换为各模型自身的控制格式。",
 "WorldMemBench, nine models": "WorldMemBench：九个模型",
 "All metrics, coloured by rank within each metric": "全部指标，按单项排名着色",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> Full results (paper Table 2). Darker means better within a row; for the two camera errors (↓), lower is better. Hover a cell for its rank.": "<b>图 4：</b>完整结果，对应论文表 2。同一行内颜色越深表示成绩越好；两项相机误差（↓）越低越好。鼠标悬停于单元格可查看排名。",
 "<strong>Static and dynamic memory are different skills.</strong> HY-WorldPlay leads all seven static-memory metrics, from human identity (0.828) to environment reconstruction (0.619), yet its dynamic-memory score is 0.294: it starts only 31.7% of the prescribed events. LingBot World (0.808) and YUME (0.775) lead dynamic memory while sitting in the middle on static metrics. No model leads on both: keeping the world unchanged and keeping it moving pull in different directions (<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">Figure 5</a>).": "<strong>静态记忆与动态记忆是两种不同的能力。</strong>HY-WorldPlay 在全部七项静态记忆指标上均居首位，从人物身份（0.828）到环境重建（0.619）均是如此，但其动态记忆得分仅为 0.294，指定事件中仅 31.7% 真正开始。动态记忆领先的是 LingBot World（0.808）和 YUME（0.775），二者的静态指标均处于中游。没有模型在两方面同时领先：保持世界不变与使世界持续变化相互制约，见<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-5\">图 5</a>。",
 "Each point is a model": "每个点是一个模型",
 "Static memory (mean of seven metrics) against dynamic memory": "静态记忆（七项指标均值）与动态记忆的关系",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> The horizontal axis is our average of the seven static-memory metrics in Table 2; the vertical axis is the Dynamic Memory Overall score. Point size is the imaging-quality score.": "<b>图 5：</b>横轴为本文对表 2 中七项静态记忆指标计算的平均值，纵轴为动态记忆总分（Dynamic Memory Overall）。点的大小表示成像质量得分。",
 "Camera following varies independently: Matrix-Game 3 has the lowest translation error (0.424) and HY-WorldPlay the lowest rotation error (0.417), and DreamX World, with the highest of both, also has the lowest environment depth and reconstruction scores. Video quality, meanwhile, varies far less across models than memory does, and says little about it.": "相机跟随的表现与记忆相对独立。Matrix-Game 3 的平移误差最低（0.424），HY-WorldPlay 的旋转误差最低（0.417）；DreamX World 两项误差均最高，其环境深度与重建得分也最低。相比之下，视频质量在模型间的差异远小于记忆指标，也难以反映记忆水平。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Memory fades with every return": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>记忆随返回次数衰减",
 "A good first return shows that a model can recover a view once. It does not show that the recovery lasts. Under LRLRLR, the nine-model average falls from the first to the third return on all seven static metrics: object appearance by 0.229, human identity by 0.217, object geometry by 0.205 and environment reconstruction by 0.196. Per model, every one is worse at the third return than the first on the human, object, visible and reconstruction metrics.": "第一次返回表现良好，仅说明模型能够恢复一次视角，并不说明这种恢复能够持续。在 LRLRLR 轨迹下，从第一次到第三次返回，九个模型的平均分在七项静态指标上全部下降：物体外观下降 0.229，人物身份下降 0.217，物体几何下降 0.205，环境重建下降 0.196。就单个模型而言，在人物、物体、可见内容和重建指标上，所有模型第三次返回的得分均低于第一次。",
 "Two things compound. The returning viewpoint drifts: mean rotation error grows from 0.430 to 0.502 to 0.530 over the three returns. And every model generates autoregressively, so early errors feed later frames. The decline survives restricting the analysis to the 431 environment rollouts whose departures and returns meet the pose criteria: visible content, depth order and reconstruction still fall by 0.152, 0.135 and 0.139.": "两方面因素相互叠加。其一，返回视角本身存在漂移：三次返回的平均旋转误差依次为 0.430、0.502 和 0.530。其二，所有模型均采用自回归生成，早期误差会传递到后续帧。仅分析离开与返回均满足位姿标准的 431 段环境 rollout，下降依然存在：可见内容、深度顺序和重建分别下降 0.152、0.135 和 0.139。",
 "One environment case, all nine models": "同一个环境样例，九个模型",
 "Visible memory at each return": "每次返回时的可见内容记忆",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Scores at the first, second and third return for one environment case (paper Figure 4). Hover a line to pick out a model. HY-WorldPlay and Evoke hold their scene; others lose it, sometimes abruptly.": "<b>图 6：</b>单个环境样例在第一、二、三次返回时的得分，对应论文图 4。鼠标悬停于折线可单独查看某一模型。HY-WorldPlay 和 Evoke 始终保持场景，其余模型会丢失场景，部分模型的丢失较为突然。",
 "<strong>Changing direction is harder still.</strong> LRLR and LRUD share their first return but differ in the second: LRLR turns left and right again, LRUD pitches up and down. Returning along a new axis costs more for every static metric on average, and for 50 of the 63 model–metric pairs; environment visible memory drops an extra 0.152.": "<strong>改变方向后返回更加困难。</strong>LRLR 与 LRUD 的第一次返回相同，区别在于第二次：LRLR 仍左右转动，LRUD 改为上下转动。沿新轴返回时，各项静态指标的平均下降幅度均更大；63 个“模型–指标”组合中有 50 个呈现这一现象，环境可见内容记忆额外下降 0.152。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>What to keep in context": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>上下文历史帧的选择",
 "Because the benchmark separates dimensions, it can be used to diagnose design choices. Holding LingBot World v2 and all generation settings fixed, we compared three training-free ways of choosing which past frames the model attends to: the <strong>full history</strong> (FullKV), only the <strong>recent window</strong> (Sliding), and recent frames plus <strong>view-relevant history</strong> retrieved by field of view (FoV), the last two under the same budget.": "WorldMemBench 对各维度分别评分，因而可用于诊断模型设计。实验固定 LingBot World v2 及全部生成设置，比较三种无需训练的历史帧选择策略：<strong>全部历史</strong>（FullKV）、仅保留<strong>最近窗口</strong>（Sliding），以及最近帧加按视场检索的<strong>视角相关历史</strong>（FoV）。后两种策略的预算相同。",
 "LingBot World v2, model and settings fixed": "LingBot World v2，模型与设置均固定",
 "Memory scores under three context policies": "三种上下文策略下的记忆得分",
 "<b>Figure 7.</b> Eleven memory metrics and end-to-end latency over 660 matched videos (paper Table 3). FoV is best on eight of eleven metrics and beats Sliding on all eleven.": "<b>图 7：</b>660 段配对视频上的十一项记忆指标与端到端延迟，对应论文表 3。FoV 在十一项指标中的八项上最优，且每一项均高于 Sliding。",
 "FoV beats the full history on all four dynamic sub-metrics and both human metrics, while full history keeps an edge on object appearance, object geometry and visible environment content. Both budgeted policies are faster: 262.7 and 260.4 seconds per video against 322.2 for full history, about 1.23× and 1.24×. Mixing recent context with view-relevant history looks like a good trade, and the benchmark shows which kinds of memory each choice helps.": "FoV 在四项动态子指标和两项人物指标上均优于全部历史，而全部历史在物体外观、物体几何和环境可见内容上仍占优。两种限定预算的策略速度更快：每段视频分别耗时 262.7 秒和 260.4 秒，全部历史为 322.2 秒，分别加速约 1.23 倍和 1.24 倍。将最近上下文与视角相关历史相结合是一种较优的折中，WorldMemBench 还能揭示每种选择具体有益于哪一类记忆。",
 "<span class=\"n\">6</span>Do the scores agree with people?": "<span class=\"n\">6</span>自动评分与人工判断的一致性",
 "For static memory, three annotators judged 504 blinded pairs of rollouts. The automatic metrics agree with the human majority on 78.5% to 92.5% of decisive pairs, and model rankings correlate with human win rates up to ρ = 0.988 for visible environment memory. For dynamic memory, three annotators answered all 400 checklist items of 50 cases; the VLM judge’s overall scores correlate with theirs at Spearman ρ = 0.732 (PLCC 0.808). Causal and physical questions are the hardest to judge, at ρ = 0.401.": "静态记忆方面，三名标注者盲评了 504 对 rollout。在有明确胜负的样本对上，自动指标与多数标注者判断的一致率为 78.5% 至 92.5%；模型排名与人工胜率的相关系数最高达 ρ = 0.988，对应环境可见内容记忆。动态记忆方面，三名标注者回答了 50 个样例的全部 400 道检查题，VLM 评判给出的总分与人工总分的 Spearman ρ 为 0.732，PLCC 为 0.808。因果与物理类问题最难判断，ρ 为 0.401。",
 "Static metric": "静态指标",
 "Agreement with human majority": "与多数标注者一致的比例",
 "Model-level Spearman ρ": "模型级 Spearman ρ",
 "Environment visible": "环境可见内容",
 "Human appearance": "人物外观",
 "Human identity": "人物身份",
 "Object appearance": "物体外观",
 "Environment depth": "环境深度",
 "Object geometry": "物体几何",
 "Citation": "引用",
 "Copy": "复制",
 "References": "参考文献",
 "Inference settings for every model, the dynamic-memory prompts and the full per-trajectory results are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">paper</a>; rollouts, scores and the evaluation code are on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> and <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>.": "各模型的推理设置、动态记忆提示词及按轨迹划分的完整结果见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.19063\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">论文</a>；rollout、评分和评测代码已在 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/rescuerz/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Hugging Face</a> 和 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/WorldMemBench\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> 公开。",
